# AgriME Environment Variables Specification
# ==============================================================================

# 1. PUBLIC CLIENT-SIDE VARIABLES (Exposed to browser via Next.js NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix)
# Supabase project URL and anon public key for row-level security authenticated operations
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# 2. SERVER-SIDE ONLY VARIABLES (NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_!)
# Optional: Government of India Open Government Data (data.gov.in) API key for live Agmarknet APMC mandi streams.
# Free registration available at: https://data.gov.in
# If omitted, AgriME safely serves verified APMC mandi reference baseline bulletins.
DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY=your-optional-data-gov-in-api-key-here
